          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aníng laya an qaás, baraá tla/angw'ín, dir'ine awa na meetiye' ngiri huúw baraá xoordu, amór Tarshishi, nee amór Puti, nee amór Ludi kudá' ga/aldaá xuá' tlaqutuwo, nee amór Tubali, nee amór Yowani, amór ayeemoodá' sawen awa afaá tlawi kudá' handá' kangw'eé' ngwa axasi'iiká nee xirfuueé' ngwaa ari'iiká. Amoodae muk'eé' xirfuueé' guri alki/iit dír xoordu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhaeehúng sleémeero kingay ki/is baraá xoordaá hatlá' wa ale adór ilahhooár anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Kingin ki/is ar faras, nee ar gaardu, nee ar /aampu, nee ar wayshama' nee ar angamiadu ay baraá gixsár Yerusalemu dír tloomar'eé' tidá' hhoohhoo'. Inooín kingi huuw, adór múk Israeli ilahhooár balaangw kingir haahuwi baraá xooslmoó hhoohhoó ar ale ay dír dooeé' anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dir'ine bahh'ale aníng in tsawaár tawa adór kaahamuusér Mungú nee tawa adór tlahhoó Laáwi. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ana oó'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Asma adoodá' dooraá /aben nee yaamaá /aben",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.22"
            ]
          }
        }
